{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"","kicker_size":3,"show_title":true,"title_size":8,"show_content":true,"content_size":5,"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"fc31c000-05b3-44e5-9c6f-052a77c8a48c":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"template--16971078959316__fc31c000-05b3-44e5-9c6f-052a77c8a48c-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"EN RUTA","text_size":8}},"template--16971078959316__fc31c000-05b3-44e5-9c6f-052a77c8a48c-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nos levantamos al alba, tomamos el auto, y con los amigos de siempre, nos dirigimos a la playa, disfrutando cada momento de la ruta. La carretera se extiende al frente y por la ventana disfrutamos del paisaje. La música suena mientras simplemente, disfrutamos del viaje.<br\/><br\/>Cada kilómetro recorrido nos aleja más de la rutina. Al final, el mar nos recibe y nos ofrece un panorama perfecto. “En Ruta” es sobre desconexión, libertad y compartir.<br\/><br\/>Bienvenida nuestra Nueva Colección<\/p>","text_size":5,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["template--16971078959316__fc31c000-05b3-44e5-9c6f-052a77c8a48c-heading-1","template--16971078959316__fc31c000-05b3-44e5-9c6f-052a77c8a48c-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_image_dhFnCQ":{"type":"section-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hola11.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":10,"padding_bottom":12}},"section_image_eiapfM":{"type":"section-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hola_1.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":24}},"section_i